{"id":4546,"date":"2025-07-04T04:03:14","date_gmt":"2025-07-04T04:03:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4546"},"modified":"2025-08-11T06:50:39","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T06:50:39","slug":"shopee-mall-la-gi-dieu-kien-cach-dang-ky","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/shopee-mall-la-gi-dieu-kien-cach-dang-ky\/","title":{"rendered":"Shopee Mall l\u00e0 g\u00ec? \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n, c\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"HS8md5CFfoK3uAxpCeel6O4Bg9f\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W8ildiT3woihuyxjYk5lSjQPgJd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee Mall l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng Shopee, n\u01a1i t\u1eadp h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn. C\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u00ean Shopee Mall \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cam k\u1ebft v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111i k\u00e8m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch h\u1eadu m\u00e3i t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n so v\u1edbi c\u00e1c gian h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng. C\u00f9ng <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">Lemeon Digital<\/a><\/strong> t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u chi ti\u1ebft ngay b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi!<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-XQX9dV39WoMR9Dxl3IRlkFb8g2E\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Shopee Mall l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OcxJd5DKwoinUmxFVtklvRewgXf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee Mall l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t khu v\u1ef1c \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed Shopee, n\u01a1i t\u1eadp h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng t\u1eeb c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn, nh\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i uy t\u00edn, ho\u1eb7c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn. C\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1ea1i Shopee Mall \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao, ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111i k\u00e8m c\u00e1c ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 trong 7-15 ng\u00e0y, mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, v\u00e0 cam k\u1ebft h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng 100%.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLy2d7LDdoXZ7vxN22ZljxIFg1b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Shopee Mall:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NW4Ndw3D6ogeqGxqHlYl5QVagfc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng 100%: \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c cam k\u1ebft b\u1edfi Shopee, n\u1ebfu ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3 s\u1ebd ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n g\u1ea5p \u0111\u00f4i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LveCdirb3oR94ExxAYlloIypgJb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed trong 7 ng\u00e0y: Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 n\u1ebfu s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u00fang m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, b\u1ecb l\u1ed7i, ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng v\u1eeba \u00fd.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WnKWd3z3ZowgE2xdXdOlzR7AgVb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Giao h\u00e0ng nhanh &amp; chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p: Th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u ti\u00ean x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u00e0 giao s\u1edbm h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GmeadpMrkoMXxJxVtoIl0XJqgrc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u00f3 d\u1ea5u hi\u1ec7u &#8220;Mall&#8221; \u0111\u1ecf: D\u1ec5 nh\u1eadn bi\u1ebft khi mua s\u1eafm.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0PHdYdOjobbYRxOxYslL0IRg0c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u1ea7n s\u1ef1 an t\u00e2m v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 h\u1eadu m\u00e3i t\u1ed1t, v\u00e0 \u01b0u ti\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng t\u1eeb c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 Samsung, Adidas, L&#8217;Or\u00e9al, Unilever\u2026<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4548\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4548\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4548\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/91.png\" alt=\"Shopee Mall l\u00e0 khu v\u1ef1c tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee, n\u01a1i t\u1eadp trung c\u00e1c gian h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/91.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/91-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/91-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/91-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/91-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4548\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Shopee Mall l\u00e0 khu v\u1ef1c tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee, n\u01a1i t\u1eadp trung c\u00e1c gian h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"HS8md5CFfoK3uAxpCeel6O4Bg9f\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TYoMdCorHoW9qUxEWR2lDcCbgbd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110i\u1ec3m kh\u00e1c nhau gi\u1eefa Shop Mall v\u00e0 shop th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00e1c<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FCdwdXNKZoY5jOxuRTElMQ7VgJb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u1ea3ng so s\u00e1nh chi ti\u1ebft gi\u1eefa Shopee Mall v\u00e0 shop th\u01b0\u1eddng (gian h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng) tr\u00ean Shopee, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 h\u00ecnh dung s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t gi\u1eefa hai lo\u1ea1i shop n\u00e0y:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-VMIqdvXFHogkMfx47ySlEPV5gOg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"186\" \/>\n<col width=\"429\" \/>\n<col width=\"429\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed<\/td>\n<td>Shopee Mall<\/td>\n<td>Shop th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/td>\n<td>Ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng 100%, t\u1eeb th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c nh\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i uy t\u00edn<\/td>\n<td>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, x\u00e1ch tay ho\u1eb7c h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng r\u00f5 ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n<\/td>\n<td>C\u00f3 logo &#8220;Mall&#8221; m\u00e0u \u0111\u1ecf b\u00ean c\u1ea1nh t\u00ean shop<\/td>\n<td>Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3, ch\u1ec9 hi\u1ec7n t\u00ean shop th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3<\/td>\n<td>\u0110\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 trong 7 ng\u00e0y, mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed n\u1ebfu \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n<\/td>\n<td>T\u00f9y t\u1eebng shop, kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea5t, nhi\u1ec1u shop kh\u00f4ng cho \u0111\u1ed5i<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">B\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m t\u1eeb Shopee<\/td>\n<td>Cam k\u1ebft h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n 2 l\u1ea7n n\u1ebfu ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3<\/td>\n<td>Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n g\u1ea5p \u0111\u00f4i t\u1eeb Shopee<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn<\/td>\n<td>Cao, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee ch\u1ecdn l\u1ecdc v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m duy\u1ec7t nghi\u00eam ng\u1eb7t<\/td>\n<td>Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m duy\u1ec7t g\u1eaft gao, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng shop kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ec1u<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3<\/td>\n<td>Th\u01b0\u1eddng cao h\u01a1n do l\u00e0 h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng<\/td>\n<td>\u0110a d\u1ea1ng, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 r\u1ebb h\u01a1n nh\u01b0ng r\u1ee7i ro v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Th\u01b0\u1eddng d\u00e0nh cho<\/td>\n<td>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng mu\u1ed1n mua h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, y\u00ean t\u00e2m b\u1ea3o h\u00e0nh<\/td>\n<td>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mu\u1ed1n mua gi\u00e1 r\u1ebb, kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 quan tr\u1ecdng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 Affiliate<\/td>\n<td>T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i cao, uy t\u00edn, d\u1ec5 qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 h\u01a1n<\/td>\n<td>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cao hoa h\u1ed3ng nh\u01b0ng c\u1ea7n ki\u1ec3m tra k\u1ef9 uy t\u00edn shop<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<blockquote class=\" old-record-id-FCaZdALk3og792xVvDOlTlXKgix\" data-type=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fta9dq3Qko5XgNxJeGwlmWhXgHf\"><strong>G\u1ee3i \u00fd<\/strong>: N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0m ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft Shopee (Shopee Affiliate), n\u00ean \u01b0u ti\u00ean ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1eeb Shopee Mall \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng ni\u1ec1m tin v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua v\u00e0 t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RNwkdTAnjoIptoxryM2l4r1tgCh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4551\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4551\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4551\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/90.png\" alt=\"S\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t ch\u00ednh gi\u1eefa Shop Mall v\u00e0 shop th\u01b0\u1eddng tr\u00ean Shopee n\u1eb1m \u1edf ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn, c\u00e1c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/90.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/90-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/90-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/90-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/90-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4551\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">S\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t ch\u00ednh gi\u1eefa Shop Mall v\u00e0 shop th\u01b0\u1eddng tr\u00ean Shopee n\u1eb1m \u1edf ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn, c\u00e1c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"HS8md5CFfoK3uAxpCeel6O4Bg9f\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-J8wDdpG9ioVbznxp0QllTbdggnc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh Shopee Mall<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-CIGFdz6teodG5lxx94Ol7PPJg1c\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh trong 4 tu\u1ea7n g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EYkJd6HfToQPJMx7jlwlYUzmgah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t gian h\u00e0ng d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh trong 4 tu\u1ea7n g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t, t\u00ednh t\u1eeb th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u1ed1t danh s\u00e1ch x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t. C\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QJ9mdpaTeoXIlQxxsDJl0QSbgpe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng: D\u01b0\u1edbi 10%. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y, tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng, ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng giao \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c do l\u1ed7i c\u1ee7a nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FlBmdssQMoXEIzxeNkslHtgFgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 giao h\u00e0ng tr\u1ec5: Ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1eef \u1edf m\u1ee9c th\u1ea5p, th\u01b0\u1eddng d\u01b0\u1edbi 5%, \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng t\u1ed1t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4O8dTp19oKAghxvPKslSDxYgLe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng: Ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nhanh ch\u00f3ng (trong v\u00f2ng 12 gi\u1edd) v\u1edbi ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n, kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u1eeb ng\u1eef th\u00f4 t\u1ee5c hay vi ph\u1ea1m ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a Shopee.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BhLmdgdR6om200xrXULlXixMgmf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110i\u1ec3m ph\u1ea1t (sao qu\u1ea3 t\u1ea1): Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 ho\u1eb7c r\u1ea5t \u00edt \u0111i\u1ec3m ph\u1ea1t do vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch, nh\u01b0 giao h\u00e0ng ch\u1eadm, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u00fang m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3\/nh\u00e1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ViDcdpQTqonGPBxOFGalTt1VgOg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m: \u0110\u0103ng b\u00e1n \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 5 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n v\u1ec1 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc c\u1ee7a n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U), v\u00e0 thu\u1ed9c t\u00ednh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ChzSdqyJZoolU0xERynlw1CHgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u00e0ng t\u1ed3n kho: Duy tr\u00ec l\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u00e0ng t\u1ed3n kho l\u1edbn v\u00e0 \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nhu c\u1ea7u mua s\u1eafm, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 11.11, 12.12.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZKtJdb2ZHoGNRVxHBLClWGWGgmg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Doanh thu v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1: Gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 doanh thu t\u1ed1t, nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u00edch c\u1ef1c (4.5 sao tr\u1edf l\u00ean), v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng giao th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng cao, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4549\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4549\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4549\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/89.png\" alt=\"Shopee kh\u00f4ng thu b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 ph\u1ee5 ph\u00ed n\u00e0o cho vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh Shopee Mall.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/89.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/89-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/89-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/89-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/89-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4549\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Shopee kh\u00f4ng thu b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 ph\u1ee5 ph\u00ed n\u00e0o cho vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh Shopee Mall.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-I4w7dsiKGo5crdxMHPXlt4bAgrd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd ph\u00e1p l\u00fd v\u00e0 ch\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SonCdhaTBossAQxUxRrli44JgSd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ph\u1ea3i cung c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00e1c gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7, t\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c kinh doanh v\u00e0 ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BFJpdy27noueJ1xhiFYldUlMg8P\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd kinh doanh: B\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi doanh nghi\u1ec7p ho\u1eb7c h\u1ed9 kinh doanh c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZhM1dcENcoyvagxPnSYlEihVg6g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Gi\u1ea5y \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u: Ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 t\u1eeb c\u01a1 quan nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ho\u1eb7c gi\u1ea5y x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. N\u1ebfu l\u00e0 nh\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i, c\u1ea7n gi\u1ea5y \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HZE6dBmIHoXyAAxXunKlOxCLged\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Gi\u1ea5y c\u00f4ng b\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m: \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1eb7c th\u00f9 nh\u01b0 m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m, th\u1ef1c ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ee9c n\u0103ng, ho\u1eb7c th\u1ef1c ph\u1ea9m (n\u1ebfu b\u00e1n n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n gi\u1ea5y n\u00e0y, nh\u01b0ng c\u1ea7n ch\u1ee9ng minh ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZqC3dr6b2oPLFZxRjm2lX8QtgNf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>CCCD\/H\u1ed9 chi\u1ebfu: C\u1ea7n c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt b\u1ea3n scan m\u00e0u \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a CCCD ho\u1eb7c h\u1ed9 chi\u1ebfu h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 tr\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1eddi h\u1ea1n Shopee y\u00eau c\u1ea7u (th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1eeb 17h th\u1ee9 T\u01b0 \u0111\u1ebfn 23h59 th\u1ee9 N\u0103m h\u00e0ng tu\u1ea7n). N\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt \u0111\u00fang h\u1ea1n, h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 s\u1ebd b\u1ecb t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GVZAd2DJzoMGxkxRJv0lkAHdg9e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd b\u1ed5 sung: N\u1ebfu s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u, c\u1ea7n ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn t\u1eeb T\u1ed5ng l\u00e3nh s\u1ef1 qu\u00e1n ho\u1eb7c B\u1ed9 Ngo\u1ea1i giao Vi\u1ec7t Nam. C\u00e1c gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd ph\u1ea3i r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, kh\u00f4ng che th\u00f4ng tin c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft, v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd. V\u00ed d\u1ee5, n\u1ebfu b\u00e1n n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n cung c\u1ea5p gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh v\u00e0 gi\u1ea5y ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3) \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ee9ng minh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ea1t ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EJCedbwudomEfExGQ25lxzO8gpc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 gian h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJ1Hdnxq4oD6dMxaK3YleWtrgEc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng 100%: S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n, h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3\/nh\u00e1i, ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng r\u00f5 ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c. V\u00ed d\u1ee5, n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng logo th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ea3o h\u1ed9 (nh\u01b0 Adidas, Chanel) tr\u00ean h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GYN5d8UMqojjEtxunMalLDL8gAd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m: H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh t\u1ef1 ch\u1ee5p, r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, kh\u00f4ng sao ch\u00e9p t\u1eeb ngu\u1ed3n kh\u00e1c, v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n Shopee Mall (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: \u1ea3nh n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ph\u1ea3i th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n r\u00f5 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EKR8dnIkBoK8dTx8crDlrn0Ygld\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u00f4 t\u1ea3 chi ti\u1ebft: S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 th\u00f4ng tin \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc, c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m 5mm, 10mm, m\u00e0u b\u1ea1c\/v\u00e0ng).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BuFoddK3foBOPnxldOglqRT4gXc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf: M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd Shopee Mall, nh\u01b0 phi\u1ebfu d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, th\u1ebb \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o l\u00f3t, bao cao su, ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng b\u1ecb Shopee c\u1ea5m theo t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3. N\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U thu\u1ed9c ng\u00e0nh n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t, th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf, nh\u01b0ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4550\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4550\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4550\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/88.png\" alt=\"Gian h\u00e0ng ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n l\u00e0 c\u00e1c gian h\u00e0ng c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u1ea5t v\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 3x3x2,5m, c\u00f3 khung nh\u00f4m v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1eddng d\u00f9ng cho c\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\u00f3 kinh ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/88.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/88-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/88-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/88-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/88-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4550\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Gian h\u00e0ng ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n l\u00e0 c\u00e1c gian h\u00e0ng c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u1ea5t v\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 3x3x2,5m, c\u00f3 khung nh\u00f4m v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1eddng d\u00f9ng cho c\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\u00f3 kinh ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UAnPddh0LouRYnxqKksl4EGvgNe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QO0fdEpPso0UaRx0aAxls1I7gIb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd Shopee Mall<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZnT8dgdWTojPMZxjoGfly65kgHg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1<\/strong>: Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd (gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh, \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, CCCD, v.v.) v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea1t c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WVBZdzB7zoE38oxR1JOl2WZEgQe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2<\/strong>: \u0110i\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd Shopee Mall t\u1ea1i link ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c ho\u1eb7c qua K\u00eanh Ng\u01b0\u1eddi B\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UubMdkoYnojvsFxtWo7lBjb1gHd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3<\/strong>: G\u1eedi h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 v\u00e0 ch\u1edd x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t trong t\u1ed1i \u0111a 14 ng\u00e0y. Shopee s\u1ebd th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 qua email ho\u1eb7c m\u1ee5c \u201cC\u1eadp Nh\u1eadt Shopee\u201d trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HpgLddSGcojMXRxl4PelUjDSgpG\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4<\/strong>: N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy\u1ec7t, c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt CCCD \u0111\u00fang h\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn danh hi\u1ec7u Shopee Mall (logo \u201cMall\u201d m\u00e0u \u0111\u1ecf xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean gian h\u00e0ng v\u00e0o 17h th\u1ee9 S\u00e1u h\u00e0ng tu\u1ea7n).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YlRxdlOWBoTUCNxjwWMlXtpEg3e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TOIydxvXNoHbTdxHboglmr4FgWf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u01afu nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m khi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shop Mall<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-X9zTdoTr8oLhYtxx1Wildr1pg60\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/h3>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Drj4daqzEoOlEOxUThnlkw9lgih\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 98.8878%; height: 264px;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"225\" \/>\n<col width=\"688\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 24px; width: 42.8957%;\"><strong>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 24px; width: 108.729%;\"><strong>M\u00f4 t\u1ea3<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px; width: 42.8957%; text-align: left;\">T\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px; width: 108.729%;\">Gian h\u00e0ng g\u1eafn nh\u00e3n \u201cMall\u201d \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn l\u00e0 ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, gi\u00fap kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tin t\u01b0\u1edfng h\u01a1n.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px; width: 42.8957%; text-align: left;\">Ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng h\u01a1n<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px; width: 108.729%;\">Shopee th\u01b0\u1eddng \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a Shopee Mall trong c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch l\u1edbn (11.11, 12.12&#8230;), gi\u00fap t\u0103ng traffic.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px; width: 42.8957%; text-align: left;\">T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i cao h\u01a1n<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px; width: 108.729%;\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua th\u01b0\u1eddng \u01b0u ti\u00ean ch\u1ecdn gian h\u00e0ng Mall v\u00ec ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 linh ho\u1ea1t, h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px; width: 42.8957%; text-align: left;\">H\u01b0\u1edfng ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px; width: 108.729%;\">\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 marketing, gi\u1ea3m ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, t\u1eb7ng m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 24px; width: 42.8957%; text-align: left;\">T\u1ed1i \u01b0u cho Affiliate Marketing<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 24px; width: 108.729%;\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m Mall d\u1ec5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c KOC\/KOL l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 h\u01a1n, v\u00ec t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn cao.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 24px; width: 42.8957%; text-align: left;\">\u00cdt c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u1ec1 gi\u00e1 h\u01a1n<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 24px; width: 108.729%;\">Do c\u00f3 cam k\u1ebft v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua \u00edt so s\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 kh\u1eaft khe nh\u01b0 c\u00e1c shop th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<h3>\u00a0<\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FPa8dC57Vox19VxTlpBlc69Vguh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-UVlpd3FJ7oqiPGx92t7lQn6zgrh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 100.234%; height: 210px;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"401\" \/>\n<col width=\"640\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 45.5319%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 93.8875%; height: 23px;\"><strong>M\u00f4 t\u1ea3<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 47px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 45.5319%; height: 47px;\">Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u cao v\u1ec1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 93.8875%; height: 47px;\">Ph\u1ea3i gi\u1eef ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 t\u1ed1t li\u00ean t\u1ee5c (t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 \u0111\u01a1n h\u1ee7y th\u1ea5p, ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nhanh&#8230;), n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng s\u1ebd b\u1ecb g\u1ee1 nh\u00e3n Mall.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 45.5319%; height: 23px;\">Ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng cao h\u01a1n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 93.8875%; height: 23px;\" data-sheet-value=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Shopee thu &quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;font&quot;:&quot;bold 10pt\/1.5 MonospacedNumber, LarkHackSafariFont, LarkEmojiFont, LarkChineseQuote, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Tahoma, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft Yahei\\&quot;, Arial, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, sans-serif, \\&quot;Apple Color Emoji\\&quot;, \\&quot;Segoe UI Emoji\\&quot;, \\&quot;Segoe UI Symbol\\&quot;, \\&quot;Noto Color Emoji\\&quot;&quot;,&quot;foreColor&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;},&quot;text&quot;:&quot;ph\u00ed c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh 2% \u2013 5% (ch\u01b0a VAT)&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot; cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng (cao h\u01a1n shop th\u01b0\u1eddng).&quot;}]\">Shopee thu ph\u00ed c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh 2% \u2013 5% (ch\u01b0a VAT) cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng (cao h\u01a1n shop th\u01b0\u1eddng).<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 47px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 45.5319%; height: 47px;\">Ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd ph\u00e1p l\u00fd \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 93.8875%; height: 47px;\">B\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c c\u00f3 gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh, \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n, ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m&#8230;<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 47px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 45.5319%; height: 47px;\">Chi ph\u00ed \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 ban \u0111\u1ea7u l\u1edbn<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 93.8875%; height: 47px;\">C\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, t\u1ed3n kho \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh, quy tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 45.5319%; height: 23px;\">Kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi h\u00e0ng x\u00e1ch tay\/h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng r\u00f5 ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 93.8875%; height: 23px;\">Shopee ki\u1ec3m duy\u1ec7t g\u1eaft gao, d\u1ec5 b\u1ecb t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng minh b\u1ea1ch xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<h2>\u00a0<\/h2>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-XKyIdiv8eoK0iixAjKQlrpP5gtg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">B\u00ed quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng doanh thu b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee Mall<\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4552\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4552\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4552\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1.png\" alt=\"B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 shop, v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4552\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 shop, v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X10ddcnJjo13IZxcJAAlgn6dgQg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 t\u0103ng doanh thu b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean <strong>Shopee Mall<\/strong>,\u00a0nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n c\u1ea7n \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a gian h\u00e0ng, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, v\u00e0 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1c b\u00ed quy\u1ebft chi ti\u1ebft, d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean th\u00f4ng tin t\u1eeb Seller Education Hub c\u1ee7a Shopee, kinh nghi\u1ec7m t\u1eeb c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n uy t\u00edn, v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng Vi\u1ec7t Nam t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn th\u00e1ng 6\/2025, tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng s\u1ed1 th\u1ee9 t\u1ef1:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SwDBdxoe3oNz3axNcoaliEa8gXf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a gian h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong> \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea1t ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n Shopee Mall b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, t\u1ef1 ch\u1ee5p, kh\u00f4ng sao ch\u00e9p, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n chi ti\u1ebft n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U (k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng). Vi\u1ebft m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m chi ti\u1ebft, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a nh\u01b0 \u201cn\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U trang tr\u00ed n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t\u201d, \u201cn\u1eb9p vi\u1ec1n c\u1eeda s\u1eaft b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean thanh t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm Shopee. Cung c\u1ea5p ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng \u0111a d\u1ea1ng (5mm, 10mm, m\u00e0u b\u1ea1c\/v\u00e0ng) v\u00e0 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt t\u1ed3n kho th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n. Duy tr\u00ec ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh t\u1ed1t, nh\u01b0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 \u0111\u01a1n kh\u00f4ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng d\u01b0\u1edbi 10%, giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00fang h\u1ea1n (tr\u1ec5 d\u01b0\u1edbi 5%), v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i kh\u00e1ch trong 12 gi\u1edd, \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef danh hi\u1ec7u Mall v\u00e0 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady. T\u1ea1o combo s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, nh\u01b0 n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m k\u00e8m keo d\u00e1n ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u00e8n LED vi\u1ec1n, \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K0BqdHExxoyHANxkxd9lpLf7g6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/strong> T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng Shopee Ads (Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm, Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1) \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea9y s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U l\u00ean top t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u1edbi t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u01b0 \u201cn\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m gi\u00e1 r\u1ebb\u201d, \u201cn\u1eb9p trang tr\u00ed n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t\u201d. \u0110\u1eb7t ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o h\u1ee3p l\u00fd (b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb 50.000 VN\u0110\/ng\u00e0y) v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i b\u00e1o c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i cao. Tham gia c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh flash sale, \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i c\u1ee7a Shopee Mall (11.11, 12.12) v\u1edbi gi\u00e1 gi\u1ea3m h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u00e0 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, gi\u00fap thu h\u00fat l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u1edbn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. \u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a Shopee Mall, nh\u01b0 \u201cDeal S\u1ed1c Mall\u201d, \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 doanh thu. H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi Shopee Affiliate, cung c\u1ea5p hoa h\u1ed3ng cao (10%-14% cho n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t) \u0111\u1ec3 KOL\/KOC qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, nh\u01b0 t\u1ea1o video TikTok v\u1ec1 c\u00e1ch l\u1eafp n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ef3odEN6bozuccxXMPSloRlRg2g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>T\u0103ng tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong> Cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi tin nh\u1eafn nhanh, gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft th\u1eafc m\u1eafc v\u1ec1 n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m (ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, c\u00e1ch l\u1eafp \u0111\u1eb7t) v\u1edbi th\u00e1i \u0111\u1ed9 th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n. \u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn, k\u00e8m h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng nh\u1ecf (nh\u01b0 m\u1eabu n\u1eb9p mini) \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1ed1t. \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00fang h\u1eb9n b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n uy t\u00edn, tr\u00e1nh t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 giao tr\u1ec5 l\u00e0m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 Mall. Khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch kh\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 5 sao b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch g\u1eedi tin nh\u1eafn c\u1ea3m \u01a1n sau mua h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c t\u1eb7ng voucher cho l\u1ea7n mua ti\u1ebfp theo. Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 linh ho\u1ea1t (7-15 ng\u00e0y) c\u1ee7a Shopee Mall l\u00e0 l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf, n\u00ean x\u1eed l\u00fd nhanh c\u00e1c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng l\u00f2ng tin.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IKqFdc9ufowRg3xfbRgliGO8g8d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u1ee7a Shopee (trong K\u00eanh Ng\u01b0\u1eddi B\u00e1n) \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i doanh thu, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i, v\u00e0 h\u00e0nh vi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u00e1n ch\u1ea1y (nh\u01b0 n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m 10mm m\u00e0u v\u00e0ng g\u01b0\u01a1ng) \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1eadp trung qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf ho\u1eb7c c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m k\u00e9m hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Theo d\u00f5i xu h\u01b0\u1edbng th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, nh\u01b0 nhu c\u1ea7u n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m trong m\u00f9a x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng (qu\u00fd 3, qu\u00fd 4), \u0111\u1ec3 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb t\u1ed3n kho v\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. Th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m c\u00e1c m\u1ee9c gi\u00e1 kh\u00e1c nhau (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: gi\u1ea3m t\u1eeb 600.000 VN\u0110 xu\u1ed1ng 550.000 VN\u0110 k\u00e8m mi\u1ec5n ship) \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecm \u0111i\u1ec3m gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u, c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u1edbi shop th\u01b0\u1eddng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VS1vdESxGonOS0x7JGjlAgcNgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng<\/strong> Tham gia c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n Shopee tr\u00ean Facebook, Telegram \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi kinh nghi\u1ec7m t\u1eeb c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n Mall kh\u00e1c, c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch m\u1edbi (nh\u01b0 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh g\u1ee1 danh hi\u1ec7u Mall t\u1eeb 10\/02\/2025 n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1). T\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 tr\u00ean m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i, nh\u01b0 video TikTok h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn l\u1eafp n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U ho\u1eb7c b\u00e0i blog v\u1ec1 l\u1ee3i \u00edch trang tr\u00ed n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t, \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi KOL\/KOC c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i l\u1edbn (5.000+ tr\u00ean TikTok\/YouTube) \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng s\u1ee9c m\u1ea1nh Shopee Affiliate. Theo d\u00f5i c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n mua s\u1eafm l\u1edbn v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb t\u1ed3n kho, \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i s\u1edbm \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00f3n \u0111\u1ea7u nhu c\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M3budhiIGo1l5Hxv6m6lJ9YWgqh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"HS8md5CFfoK3uAxpCeel6O4Bg9f\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L5UbdQynvotCxoxuZu1lJx29gzg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjRdllnroZ12rxj4kNlbfNggih\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4Udd1Rhqo93pGxBF8Ol9FyygDg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WPjNdSTTYof2YUxYCOXl5V0QgRg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OvnId1awwoew1nxHjBtlxJBvgWY\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shopee Mall l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng Shopee, n\u01a1i t\u1eadp h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn. C\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u00ean Shopee Mall \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cam k\u1ebft v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111i k\u00e8m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4772,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1,30],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4546","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-tin-tuc","category-kien-thuc-shopee"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4546","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4546"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4546\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5192,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4546\/revisions\/5192"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/4772"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4546"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4546"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4546"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.o